        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2012 World Indoor Archery Championships, World Archery Festival, second Indoor Archery World Cup finals\n- Places: South Point Hotel, Casino & Spa\n- People: Michael Gaughan, Brendan Gaughan\n- Topics: ownership, sponsorship\n\nFacts:\n- The 2012 World Indoor Archery Championships were contested at the South Point Hotel, Casino & Spa.\n- The 2012 World Indoor Archery Championships were followed by the World Archery Festival.\n- The 2012 World Indoor Archery Championships were also followed by the finals of the second Indoor Archery World Cup.\n- Michael Gaughan owns and operates the South Point Hotel, Casino & Spa.\n- The South Point Hotel, Casino & Spa is the primary sponsor of Brendan Gaughan's race car.\n- Brendan Gaughan is Michael Gaughan's son.",
